{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年31歲的TVB小花羅雪妍（Uki），憑處境劇《愛‧回家之開心速遞》中飾演接龍女職員「Gigi」而為人熟知。今《開心速遞》已結束，不少演員陷「劇荒」，而醒目的羅雪妍早在劇終前已未雨綢繆，沒拍戲時轉型做普通OL。早前羅雪妍在社交媒體分享到葵涌佛羅倫薩小鎮掃貨片段。羅雪妍透露要自己出錢買出席活動的衣服，並呻：「所以點解要返4份工」。</p><figure><img alt=\"羅雪妍褪去藝人光環化身普通OL。（小紅書＠罗雪妍 Uki law）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151222710186020864706359.png/WsndI1ltRtMCZ8HMb7E9iItsjqnxSdWZEoFCUxKBQlM\"/><figcaption>羅雪妍褪去藝人光環化身普通OL。（小紅書＠罗雪妍 Uki law）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"羅雪妍曾親揭電視台女藝員艱辛日常。（IG@theboudoirhousehongkong）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151223537957081088493758.jpeg/nwUNYJhjUKV9dVqRJZ4H92dK1tFzNjScOuW3CDrltwg\"/><figcaption>羅雪妍曾親揭電視台女藝員艱辛日常。（IG@theboudoirhousehongkong）</figcaption></figure><p>羅雪妍掃兩大袋名牌戰利品</p><p>羅雪妍早前拍片分享到葵涌Outlet掃貨的片段。她指在這裏有不少名牌，故常在這裏買出席藝人活動的衫褲。羅雪妍一到達即先衝去巴黎世家（Balenciaga）掃袋及上衣，第二、三間愛店則是Burberry及Tory Burch，羅雪妍開心地狂試衫試鞋，掃到兩大袋戰利品。有網民留言驚訝問：「用自己錢買？」羅雪妍回覆：並呻：「所以點解要返4份工」。另有人問她是否有買名牌風褸，羅雪妍稱都要考慮，「沒 1萬 考慮中」。</p><figure><img alt=\"羅雪妍先掃巴黎世家。（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175846745692049408207398.png/HgRwXyUa9BeYkUH2P_uz9YHzu6o-1P500_1KVdP9SlU\"/><figcaption>羅雪妍先掃巴黎世家。（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"掃貨好開心。（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175846743234056192290368.png/D_GiRE7AfpGEVMJzkCxtOMT7Umdkql5iQhaMFkIWjBY\"/><figcaption>掃貨好開心。（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"掃袋！（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175846740616679424825963.png/idYyUfYrAanIQBkWiYrh2gT1Itah8DX7Fs8KLBbPCiw\"/><figcaption>掃袋！（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"第一袋戰利品！（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175846738188046336942706.png/IjT-Is4Jr0jMSG5QfZ2s4tt9sJMOpfPBSzkBM0s5ATM\"/><figcaption>第一袋戰利品！（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"繼續買！（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175846745805426688486279.png/8JGd0X1SDR978cN2PHYN_qdL8HX5w5EQ223UQ9tt1EM\"/><figcaption>繼續買！（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"掃到兩大袋名牌。（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175846742978334720562871.png/FGI_fmbSNi3pZAcEO58CtnoceWi71tTDBlCTZQZQk2U\"/><figcaption>掃到兩大袋名牌。（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"羅雪妍指要買名牌「撐場面」。（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175846740658753536275930.png/1qqdDu0Rg3qrBSBpFfHZL-kasMYa38v0FJ3rHBSd6xw\"/><figcaption>羅雪妍指要買名牌「撐場面」。（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"羅雪妍指要返4份工買衫。（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175846738574053376426590.png/qNznY5w1x6ICxAFxOFwkX_mivd6PKxsVsSagybEmoMk\"/><figcaption>羅雪妍指要返4份工買衫。（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"羅雪妍回覆網民留言。（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260913/1175846736439021568086354.png/qJT_O1TH9-fHTab1R0XUUW4p3iruQRHLXg3MUF4NzFA\"/><figcaption>羅雪妍回覆網民留言。（小紅書@羅雪妍 Uki law）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T16:18:23.378010+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":701,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}